    "body": "Hmm. I was thinking of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#enqueuejob(queuename,-job,-arguments) step 8.1, which indeed looks at the realm of the handler. You're totally right then.\r\n\r\nIn that case I'd be prepared to flip-flop back to recommending rejected promises for cases like that. What do you think? I think the code in your OP is still prevented from infinite-looping by 8.1.",
